WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.625
The narrow bit has a projecting tip at its far end. The close-up looks back at the bolt talon.

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:04.125
The tip is now beyond the wards. Only the narrow connecting strip has to turn between them.

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.583
The connecting strip clears both wards. The working tip has reached the face of the talon.

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:07.708
The rounded tip is pressing the talon and sliding the bolt to the right.

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:09.500
The bolt head is out of its keeper. The wards have stayed still throughout.
